---
/**
 * The second required bold section — full-bleed Guard Green Deep,
 * white Fraunces text. One of the two sanctioned centered-alignment
 * exceptions (a pull-quote-style moment), not a routine section head,
 * which is why this is hand-styled from the type-scale utilities
 * directly rather than through SectionHeading (which is deliberately
 * left-aligned-only and Ink-only for every routine heading on the
 * site).
 */
---

<section class="on-dark bg-guard-green-deep">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-gutter py-24 text-center md:px-12 md:py-32">
    <p class="text-h1 text-paper italic">
      "Give clients complete peace of mind, while we keep watch."
    </p>
    <p class="text-body-lg text-paper/70 mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl">
      Our aim is to become a leading supplier of close protection and
      guarding services across the North West and Yorkshire.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
